Match the Plateau with its Location:
Plateaus:
A. Chota Nagpur Plateau;
B. Malwa Plateau;
C. Karnataka Plateau;
D. Deccan Plateau
Locations:
1. Located in central India, known for its rich mineral resources;
2. Spreads across the states of Madhya Pradesh and Rajasthan;
3. Covers parts of Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, and Telangana;
4. Extends across southern India and is bordered by the Eastern and Western Ghats.
